        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Prague</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 880 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Founded</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prague-castle">Prague Castle</a> was begun by Bořivoj around 880, on a fortified settlement that had existed on the site since 800; legend attributes the city's founding to the duchess Libuše and her husband Přemysl.</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val">On the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vltava">Vltava</a> river in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bohemia">Bohemia</a>, in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/czech-republic">Czech Republic</a>, with the castle on the west bank and the fort of Vyšehrad to the south.</span></div>
