          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Prague is the capital and largest city of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/czech-republic">Czech Republic</a>, with a population of about 1.4 million.</span></div>
